{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Pro Cam》是一款專為攝影師、影片創作者及 YouTuber 設計的專業相機 App，提供模擬底片風格、電影級錄影及完整手動控制功能。目前限時免費，原價 US $0.99，適合追求高品質影像與精準設定的使用者立即下載。</p>\n\n<h2>電影級錄影與專業監看工具</h2>\n<p>支援 ProRes 錄製、Log 與 Log2 設定檔，可還原最大動態範圍，錄影途中亦可調整曝光與對焦。內建斑馬紋、峰值對焦與即時曝光監測，輔助構圖與精確對焦。支援多種相片與影片格式、RAW 相片、外接儲存裝置，並可套用 LUT 濾鏡進行電影調色，滿足專業製作流程需求。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-511-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-512-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-513-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-514-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-515-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-516-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Pro Cam – Portrait &amp; Cinema</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T15:43:27.882314+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}